#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Publish one private Gazebo scene display to the session RTSP path.

This process is intentionally a small supervisor.  It owns a lease-private X
server, a host ``gzclient`` and FFmpeg, so the worker can stop the complete
pipeline by stopping this one process group.  The simulation container stays
untouched: only its validated private Gazebo endpoint is consumed.
"""

